{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 9189T  RentGuarantor Holdings PLC  09 September 2026   09 September 2026RentGuarantor Holdings PLC(the \"Company\" or \"RentGuarantor\")Purchase of Shares by ChairmanRentGuarantor (AIM: RGG), a leading provider of rent guarantee services, which includes property protection, to tenants and…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 9189T  RentGuarantor Holdings PLC  09 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["09 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["RentGuarantor Holdings PLC"]},{"type":"p","children":["(the \"Company\" or \"RentGuarantor\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Purchase of Shares by Chairman"]},{"type":"p","children":["RentGuarantor (AIM: RGG), a leading provider of rent guarantee services, which includes property protection, to tenants and landlords in the UK1 private rental sector, announces that Graham Duncan, Non-Executive Chairman, purchased 20,000 Ordinary Shares of 10p each (\"Ordinary Shares\") at a price of 94p per Ordinary Share on 4 September 2026.  Mr Duncan now has a total interest in 653,333 Ordinary Shares, which is equivalent to 0.40% of the voting rights in the Company."]},{"type":"p","children":["Further details are provided below in accordance with the requirements of the UK Market Abuse Regulation."]},{"type":"p","children":["To engage with this announcement on our Investor Hub, please use the following link: https://investorhub.rentguarantor.com/link/P3xdoy"]},{"type":"p","children":["For more information, please contact:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["RentGuarantor Holdings PLC"]},{"type":"p","children":["Paul Foy, Chief Executive Officer"]},{"type":"p","children":["+44 207 193 4418"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kam Bansil / Ian Mitchell, Investor Relations"]},{"type":"p","children":["+44 207 039 1901"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p",